# Board-specific recovery properties for the Unisoc USB gadget.
#
# Values observed via getprop in the stock Android environment:
#   sys.usb.configfs=1
#   sys.usb.controller=musb-hdrc.1.auto
#
# These values have not been independently verified in stock recovery.
# They select the USB configuration path; they do not by themselves prove
# that the ConfigFS gadget and FunctionFS services initialize successfully.
# Set them during init so TWRP's USB configuration uses ConfigFS and the
# actual MUSB UDC instead of the legacy android_usb path.
on init
    setprop sys.usb.configfs 1
    setprop sys.usb.controller musb-hdrc.1.auto
